== Trivia ==
* The [[Anti:Polty|Polty]] first appeared in the ''Antibirth'' mod where it had 20&nbsp;hp and 3 stage hp.
* "Polty" is a nickname of the word "poltergeist" as it behaves quite similarly to one. In lore, poltergeists are known to be [[wikipedia:Poltergeist|"responsible for physical disturbances, such as loud noises and objects being moved or destroyed."]]
* "Kineti" is a shortened version of the word "[[wikipedia:Kinetic energy|kinetic]]," which describes the form of energy that an object possesses due to its motion.

== Bugs ==
{{Bug|Petrifying Kinetis while they are pulling a rock towards them causes the rock to keep flying and can cause it to fly out of the room.}}

